{
  "id": "ui-stat-tile-row",
  "title": "Stat tile row: the top of an admin screen",
  "description": "Four tiles across the shell, unwrapped so they share the width evenly. Each tile is a card with a muted uppercase label, one large --text-3xl semibold value, and a small delta line in the success or muted colour. The value is the only large thing in the tile — a tile where the label competes with the number reads as a form, not a dashboard. Wire each value from a Query Records count or a Cloud Function output; the label and unit are static.",
  "demonstrates": [
    "Group",
    "Text"
  ],
